<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>uses<sp/>the<sp/>internal<sp/>loopback<sp/>test<sp/>mode<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>UART<sp/>module.<sp/>UART<sp/>RX<sp/>interrupt</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">is<sp/>used<sp/>with<sp/>FIFO<sp/>level<sp/>2.<sp/>The<sp/>receive<sp/>ISR<sp/>verifies<sp/>the<sp/>received<sp/>data.<sp/>It<sp/>then<sp/>prepares<sp/>and<sp/>sends</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">data<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>next<sp/>transmission.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>sent<sp/>data<sp/>looks<sp/>like<sp/>this:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\code</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>00<sp/>01</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>01<sp/>02</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>02<sp/>03</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>....<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>FE<sp/>FF</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>FF<sp/>00</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>etc..</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcode</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>pattern<sp/>is<sp/>repeated<sp/>forever.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\note<sp/>Avoid<sp/>keeping<sp/>the<sp/>memory<sp/>browser<sp/>open<sp/>while<sp/>the<sp/>execution<sp/>is<sp/>in<sp/>progress.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x</highlight></codeline>
